# The prevention test stage bakes the development realm its internal/directory
# tests read, and that document lives under deploy/, which is kept out of every
# build context. This re-includes exactly that one file and nothing else: the
# rest of deploy/ stays out, so no other service's context grows.
!deploy/local/firewatch-realm.json
